&GAS

MATERIAL ARGON 100 density 1.395 work 23.3 fano 0.117
*MIX ARGON 100

gas-id "Liquid Argon"

pressure     1.0  bar
temperature  87.7 K

cluster  
0 0 
1 100


parameters a    39.94
parameters z    18
parameters rho  1.395
parameters e-pair 23.3
parameters e-most-probable 2.1e6
parameters mean 1
parameters transverse-ion-diffusion thermal
parameters longitudinal-ion-diffusion thermal

table e/p drift
*read in velocity table from our global fit with different temperature
*ICARUS at 89K
*<./gas_file/table_89k.txt
*ProtoDUNE/DUNE at 87.7K
<./gas_file/table_87.7k.txt
*MicroBooNE at 89.6K
*<./gas_file/table_89.6k.txt

*The line below removed the velocity definition above
add drift-velocity v_LAr VS E_LAr
interpolation drift-velocity quadratic
extrapolation low-drift-velocity linear high-drift-velocity linear
add ion-mobility 1.6e-9
add townsend 0


*options gas-plot gas-print
*plot-options drift lin-x range 0 1.0 lin-y range 0.0 0.2 nodiffusion notownsen 
*>./testzone/gas_file.txt
*print E_LAr
&MAIN
